OL,3,AKing pays Andrew's #1.5m repair bill on
OL,4,ARoyal Lodge
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has paid Andrew
OL,7,FMountbatten-Windsor's #1.5m repair bill
OL,8,Fthat's owed for the poor condition of
OL,9,FMountbatten-Windsor's former home at
OL,10,FRoyal Lodge in Windsor.
OL,12,FIt's understood that the money is
OL,13,Fcoming from the King's private income -
OL,14,Fand will cover what Andrew owes his
OL,15,Fformer landlords, the Crown Estate, on
OL,16,Fleaving Royal Lodge.
OL,18,FThere was a total #1.8m penalty for the
OL,19,F"dilapidations" to Royal Lodge, but
OL,20,Fthat has been reduced by the #300,000
OL,21,FMountbatten-Windsor would have received
OL,22,Ffor an early surrender of his lease.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
