OL,3,AFort Hood survivor supports gunman's
OL,4,Aexecution by firing squad but questions
OL,5,Alivestream
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former US Army sergeant who survived
OL,8,Fthe mass shooting at the Fort Hood base
OL,9,Fhas said that while he supported the
OL,10,Fexecution of the gunman by firing
OL,11,Fsquad, he was concerned about it being
OL,12,Flivestreamed.
OL,14,FAlonzo Lunsford, who was shot seven
OL,15,Ftimes, told the BBC that the "method is
OL,16,Fbefitting" for Nidal Hasan's execution
OL,17,Fbecause other methods like lethal
OL,18,Finjection would be "doing him a
OL,19,Ffavour".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
