OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFort Hood survivor supports gunman's
OL,4,Aexecution by firing squad but questions
OL,5,Alivestream
OL,6,
OL,7,FHasan, then a US Army psychiatrist,
OL,8,Ffatally shot 13 unarmed US soldiers in
OL,9,Fa medical building at Fort Hood, in
OL,10,FTexas, in 2009.
OL,12,FBut while Lunsford agreed with the
OL,13,Fmethod of execution, he said it was
OL,14,F"not something you should view for
OL,15,Fentertainment purposes".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
